  render_theorem(sec, "Exponent-Degree", "Exponent sum for Z/970,200: 3+2+2+2+1 = 10. For Z/12,612,600: 3+2+2+2+1+1 = 11. Z/970,200 is the unique ring where exponent sum = Hamming degree.");
